asserted.&quot;@en</td></tr><tr><td align='left'>skos:note</td><td align='left'>&quot;A verifiedUsing provides an IntegrityMethod with which the integrity of an
Element can be asserted.

Please note that different profiles may also provide additional methods for
verifying the integrity of specific subclasses of Elements.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
