The description of the PlanAction is a mandatory property.

Relationship:

For each PlanAction there is at least one /Core/Relationship class or subclass with the relationshipType of &#x27;generates’ on the to and a PlanProcess class or subclass on the from.&quot;@en</td></tr></table> > ] 
